  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjarva.bloom.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ars.guide/banner.gif\" alt=\"\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LICENSE-LGPL--3.0-fe7d37?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TAVnu2xqrR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-6A7EC2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau 的 All The Modium 相容模組</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li>配方需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></li>\n<li>提供 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a> 的可選配方支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>新增 Allthemodium、Vibranium 與 Unobtanium 的奧術師盔甲，並提供完全可自訂的屬性與能力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CjWrGh3.png\" alt=\"盔甲展示\"></p>",
